{"url": "https://www.bsu.edu/admissions/graduate/our-graduate-programs", "final_url": "https://www.bsu.edu/admissions/graduate/our-graduate-programs", "status": 200, "method": "http", "fetched": "2026-10-28", "text": "Graduate Programs | Admissions | Ball State University\nProspective Students\nCurrent Students\nFaculty / Staff\nAlumni\nParents\nDirectory\nContact Us\nApply\nMake a Gift\nToggle search\nToggle navigation\nAcademics\nAdmissions\nCampus Life\nAbout\nGive\nCalendar\nNews\nAthletics\nProspective Students\nCurrent Students\nFaculty / Staff\nAlumni\nParents\nDirectory\nContact Us\nApply\nMake a Gift\nSearch Button\nOpen for More Navigation\nOpen for More Navigation\nGraduate Admissions\nApply to a Graduate Program\nOur Graduate Programs\nDiscover Ball State Graduate School\nOnline Graduate Admissions\nThe Graduate School\nPsychology Exploration\nContact Us\nOur Graduate Programs\nAdmissions\nGraduate Admissions\nOur Graduate Programs\nRequest Info\nAttend an Event\nApply\nExpand your career and enhance your expertise through a Ball State graduate study program. Explore opportunities for your next degree or certificate in your area of interest.\nFind Master's Degrees Find Certificates Find Doctoral Degrees\nAlready know what graduate program you'd like to learn more about? Select from our lists by degree.\nMaster's Degrees\nGraduate Certificates\nDoctoral Degrees\nSpecialist in Education Degrees\nNondegree Studies\nPost-Bac Licensures\nMaster's Degrees\nAt Ball State, you can pursue a wide range of master\u2019s degrees to prepare for careers in business, government, education, health care, and more.\nRequest More Information\nCollege of Architecture and Planning\nArchitecture (MARCH)\nHistoric Preservation\nInterior Design\nLandscape Architecture (MLA)\nUrban Design (MUD)\nUrban and Regional Planning\nCollege of Communication, Information, and Media\nCommunication Studies: Liberal Arts and Sciences\nCommunication Studies: Organizational and Professional Co